{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51359","headline":"过华山（句）（《全唐诗》四八四作杨虞卿句） · 杨茂卿","name":"过华山（句）（《全唐诗》四八四作杨虞卿句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（《云谿友议》卷中《中山诲》云：「杨危〖应作茂〗卿配校书《过华山》诗曰〖见下〗。\n此句实爲佳对。\n又《唐语林》二《文学》，刘禹锡茂卿云。\n〖见下〗此诗题云《过华山下作》。\n而用莲蓬之菡萏。\n极的当而暗静矣。\n」）河势崑仑远，山形菡萏秋。\n（《唐诗纪事》三九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨茂卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}